Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.88,0:22:39.04,ED,,0,0,0,,将会成为最棒的年轻人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.20,0:23:05.70,ED,,0,0,0,,直到我看见你的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.70,0:23:14.20,ED,,0,0,0,,我用双手暖暖
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.20,0:23:22.50,ED,,0,0,0,,这杯冷冰的咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.50,0:23:25.70,ED,,0,0,0,,我在等你 女孩 (I'm waiting for you girl)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.70,0:23:29.70,ED,,0,0,0,,自从你出生的那一天起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.70,0:23:38.42,ED,,0,0,0,,我就一直在等待这一天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.42,0:23:41.66,ED,,0,0,0,,等待你的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.66,0:23:45.70,ED,,0,0,0,,时代不断复杂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.70,0:23:55.18,ED,,0,0,0,,我只想沉溺于你心中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.67,0:01:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,光希…能和松浦君和好真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.09,0:01:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,果然光希和松浦君在一起的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,最自然地闪耀着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像也找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.49,0:02:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,当我最自然的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.92,0:02:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,（茗子）呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.22,0:02:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,（电话铃声）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.93,0:02:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,（光希）是~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.31,0:02:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,（推音）（光希）喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.27,0:02:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 我是北原（光希）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.06,0:02:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,光希小姐吧？晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.32,0:02:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…晚上好 是找游吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.57,0:02:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？游君
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.20,0:02:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下我想可能是自己的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,最近每天都是杏树打来的电话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.42,0:02:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,游！（敲门）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.22,0:03:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,游？什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,杏树来电话了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.23,0:03:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.65,0:03:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,（游）吧！啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.69,0:03:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是啊哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.78,0:03:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,真的哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.65,0:03:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,和杏树说话的游声音非常明亮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.49,0:03:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,以前的朋友…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.71,0:03:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是怎样的朋友呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我想问问游
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,被认为又在吃醋也有点害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.43,0:03:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,（叹气）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.14,0:03:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,北原杏树？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.97,0:03:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们中学没有那样的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.69,0:03:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,让您久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,……那孩子怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.73,0:04:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不 没什么！真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.82,0:04:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么大不了的……（亚梨实）嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.78,0:04:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,亚梨实今天是不是和银太？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.87,0:04:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但是因为来得太早了所以想起了这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是的谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了…银太和亚梨实相处得很顺利！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好漂亮！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,长崎的特产 谢谢 游
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.74,0:04:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,「老师」（铃）老师…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但是还没学习呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.33,0:04:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那么马上开始吗？诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.13,0:04:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,啊这么说来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.46,0:05:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,小铃的父亲设计的剧场也看了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.26,0:05:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,果然不愧是学到了很多东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.22,0:05:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 游 你也给光希买礼物了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.35,0:05:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？当然了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.36,0:05:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.65,0:05:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,秘密来吧打开英语课本
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.95,0:05:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,已经！玩捉迷藏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.29,0:05:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,「老师」（铃）老师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.71,0:05:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,和光希和好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,（银太）哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:06:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈…糟了 大幅度迟到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.77,0:06:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.69,0:06:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,离铃木同学远点！（男性）啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧？铃木同学
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.17,0:06:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系吗？（男性）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.92,0:06:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,须王你要干什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.13,0:06:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,啊……铃木被奇怪的家伙缠上了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.22,0:06:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只是被问路而已
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.02,0:06:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,（男性）你是在说什么？-三角关系吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.02,0:06:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,（嘈杂声）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,已经！不管了！啊铃木！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.53,0:06:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,（银太）不好～…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.57,0:06:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.41,0:06:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:06:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.91,0:07:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,（男性）啊…那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.50,0:07:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,啊是吗颠倒了啊哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.01,0:07:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,小萤
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我和游和好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.19,0:07:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,「坠链」也再次收下了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.62,0:07:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 是明天打工的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.38,0:07:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,俱乐部之后可以去「Junk Jungle」吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.85,0:07:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,明天我要休息
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,和杏树约好见面
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.40,0:08:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,好久没见了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.11,0:08:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,「不仅仅是电话 见一面慢慢说吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.11,0:08:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.54,0:08:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,如果可以的话光希也去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.62,0:08:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是？杏树也会高兴的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,说了「想和光希慢慢说」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.71,0:08:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵…和我？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,「真是可爱的女朋友啊」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…真糟糕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.93,0:08:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊游和我的女朋友也在跟我说话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.10,0:08:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我就算了 明天你一个人去见杏树吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.65,0:08:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,也有积压的话吧？是吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,（萤）嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不夺取光希呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢吧？光希的事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.92,0:09:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好不容易在万圣节派对上我给你创造了机会
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.18,0:09:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,游和光希不是和好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.48,0:09:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.85,0:09:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我一次也没有让你做过什么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,回去吧孩子游的时间结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,（呼叫音）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.33,0:09:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,（呼叫音）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,已经！不管了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 铃木同学？那个……今天…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.68,0:10:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,（电话中断的声音）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.01,0:10:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,（不通音）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,（叹气）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.77,0:10:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,（茗子）演唱会？明天？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没能预约到的票突然到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.40,0:10:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好！这是规定
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.03,0:10:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那就这样吧早点见面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.66,0:10:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,音乐会前两个人好好吃饭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.41,0:10:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,OK？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.92,0:10:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,OK呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,（门的开关声）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,（桃井）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.26,0:10:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,（再生音）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我是名村
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.27,0:10:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,明天因为工作要去那里了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.14,0:10:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我一会儿再给你打电话……那么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.86,0:10:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,（停止音）哼哼…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.37,0:11:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.04,0:11:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,光希！对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.01,0:11:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,光希 你发呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.43,0:11:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,现在游和杏树在一起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.73,0:11:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,总是吃醋的女人不可爱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.86,0:12:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈…喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.74,0:12:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,是的！光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,OK！嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好路线！光希
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.34,0:12:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好像是游君啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,（游们的笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.68,0:12:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,（游）糟了（杏树）呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,即便如此 安
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.31,0:12:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那个时候我也明白了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.69,0:12:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,游君？不是游君吗？（游）嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.24,0:12:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是安吗？那个用编辫头发髻的…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我也知道这很不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.38,0:12:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,个子也还只有这个程度
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.42,0:12:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,脸也会更像孩子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.51,0:13:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是孩子所以是理所当然的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.80,0:13:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.10,0:13:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但是即使是游君
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,「アン」这个称呼不是很熟悉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.64,0:13:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,因为没有其他人那样称呼我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.81,0:13:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好怀念啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.23,0:13:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.23,0:13:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.15,0:13:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,因为很有冲击性的杏树的第一印象是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,打我！嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.36,0:13:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,安就这样把吉尔伯特的头
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,用石板敲了（游）诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,所以石板是两半！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.16,0:14:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,「安」？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.91,0:14:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这本书的主人公
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那时的游看起来很寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.43,0:14:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我想设法给你打气…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.14,0:14:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,想要打起精神的家伙突然打我的头吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我只想到了那个
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.11,0:14:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,……这是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.23,0:14:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.70,0:14:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但是确实是转换了心情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.82,0:14:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我被吓了一跳 一瞬间烦恼的事情都忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.59,0:15:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就放弃了 朋友给我打电话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.13,0:15:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,「不需要两张吗」（茗子）呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.80,0:15:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,果然神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.51,0:15:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是考虑到我们两个了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.10,0:15:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,到演唱会还有很多时间
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.98,0:15:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,想吃什么？（茗子）嗯…是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.86,0:15:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,（桂子）茗子！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.24,0:15:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,桂子…同学
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.41,0:15:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？很辛苦茗子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.91,0:15:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,「看了」是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.79,0:15:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,小夏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.75,0:15:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.93,0:15:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,哈…在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.85,0:15:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不久前在Junk Jungle附近
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我追了 但是混在人群里了…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.73,0:16:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,真的是名村老师吗？认错人了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.57,0:16:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,被这么说的话有点自信…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.36,0:16:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我穿着很眼熟的毛衣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.37,0:16:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,（悟史）茗子！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,茗子…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.97,0:16:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,三轮同学…（悟史）不要走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.18,0:16:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,请让我走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我说绝对不行的话？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我以为心情已经决定好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.57,0:16:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我是这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.83,0:16:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,（茗子）但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.67,0:17:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.01,0:17:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,随你的便
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.27,0:18:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,铃木应该还在生气吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.52,0:18:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,银太说了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.15,0:18:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.78,0:18:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,（打中的声音）来！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.15,0:18:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈…银太这里不是足球部！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.08,0:18:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了！只有在这种时候才能好好看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.66,0:18:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈…咦？嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.34,0:18:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,茗子？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.42,0:18:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧 今天应该和三轮同学一起看演唱会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.31,0:18:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,（茗子）哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.88,0:19:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为真的想清了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,（警笛）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.02,0:20:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没能忘记
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.51,0:20:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,名村老师！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.27,0:20:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,（名村）茗子…（茗子）名村老师！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,茗…秋月
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.11,0:20:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说看到老师了 在街上到处找…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但是找不到…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.91,0:21:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,（茗子的哭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.33,0:21:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,老师？我应该已经和你分手了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.38,0:21:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为这个也得还呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,老师！（哭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.10,0:21:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,现在已经很晚了 快回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.94,0:21:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你父母也会担心的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.32,0:21:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,老师…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.99,0:21:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,快回去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.32,0:21:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,讨厌！不回去！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.79,0:21:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,（叹气）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.83,0:21:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我在和亮子交往
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.50,0:21:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.51,0:22:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在在和亮子交往
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.36,0:22:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.07,0:22:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,对亚梨实的所想也实现2人的关系急接近！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.41,0:22:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,和那个相比游的话 最近总是和杏树见面
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.08,0:22:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系吧？只是青梅竹马吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.83,0:22:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这时杏树出现在我面前…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.34,0:22:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,「橘子酱男孩」「杏树的想法」
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.42,0:22:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,（杏树）「光希之后就可以了！」